# Terraform working state (keep .terraform.lock.hcl tracked for reproducible builds)
infra/terraform/.terraform/
infra/terraform/*.tfplan
infra/terraform/tfplan
infra/terraform/*.tfstate
infra/terraform/*.tfstate.*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local artifacts (never commit)
*.log
.env
.env.*
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
docs/specs/

# Demo build outputs and local-only inputs (see docs/plans/06-demo-build.md)
infra/**/.terraform/
infra/**/*.tfstate
infra/**/*.tfstate.*
infra/**/tfplan
infra/terraform/envs/demo.tfvars
build/
*.zip
loadtest/tokens.json
evidence/
